      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00047",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "即便如此，昆虫的数量怕也太少了吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even so, the number of insects was probably far too small, wasn't it?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00047",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "也许是沙的流动过于激烈的关系吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Perhaps it was because the movement of the sand was too violent.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00047",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "可灰心似乎还太早。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But it still seemed too early to lose heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00047",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "因为理论上保证了可能性。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After all, the possibility was guaranteed in theory.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
